      <release timestamp="1792454400" type="stable" version="0.8.7">
        <description>
          <p>Adds a Shell switch to turn the shell tool off in chat, a separate image size limit, and built-in subagents for the Jan agent; keeps project threads in their project when a document is attached, sends pasted @decorators as typed, makes Stop end the whole turn, and stops local chat failing behind a proxy</p>
        </description>
      </release>
      <release timestamp="1791504000" type="stable" version="0.8.6">
        <description>
          <p>A hotfix for 0.8.5: NVIDIA Turing GPUs (GTX 16xx, RTX 20xx) run the CUDA engine again on older drivers, Qwen3.8 with MTP is fast again when Parallel Sequences is auto, and images returned by MCP tools reach the model as images</p>
        </description>
      </release>
      <release timestamp="1791417600" type="stable" version="0.8.5">
        <description>
          <p>A fixes release: the llama.cpp engine (0.5.0) now ships inside the app and runs in its own worker process with CUDA and Vulkan, the jan command-line agent is no longer bundled, the Local API Server enforces Trusted Hosts when bound to 0.0.0.0, and a batch of llama.cpp, MCP, platform and agent fixes</p>
        </description>
      </release>
    </releases>
